  "kind": "bit-matching-detail",
  "title": "YIELDMAT groups ((1 + DIM/B*rate) - term2) / term2 * (B / DSM) with every step stored from x87 PC64",
  "statement": "In Excel 16.0.20131 and 16.0.20527, YIELDMAT(settlement, maturity, issue, rate, pr, [basis]) evaluates term2 = pr/100 + (A/B)*rate, term1 = (1 + (DIM/B)*rate) - term2, and (term1 / term2) * (B / (DIM - A)) with every arithmetic operation double-rounded from x87 PC64 to binary64. The left-to-right F# regrouping dim/b*rate + 1 - pr/100 - a/b*rate differs by 1 to 2 ULP. All 1,085 full-bank and 120 pinned YIELDMAT rows match.",
  "status": "measured",
  "basis": "Measured across Excel 16.0.20131 (1,085/1,085 full-bank and 120/120 pinned YIELDMAT rows) and 16.0.20527.20088 in prefix_metadata (row 398).",
